# Input
```html
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->
<button disabled>Save</button>
<button role="switch" disabled>Save</button>
<button disabled="false">Save</button>
<BUTTON DISABLED>Save</BUTTON>

<input type="button" disabled>
<input type="submit" disabled>
<input type="reset" disabled>
<input type="image" disabled>
<input type="SUBMIT" disabled>

<input disabled>
<input type="text" disabled>
<input type="EMAIL" disabled>
<input type="date" disabled>
<input type="number" disabled>
<input type="'submit'" disabled>
<input type="text" role="button" disabled>
<textarea disabled></textarea>
<textarea role="button" disabled></textarea>
<TEXTAREA DISABLED></TEXTAREA>

<input type="checkbox" disabled>
<input type="radio" disabled>
<input type="range" disabled>
<input type="color" disabled>
<input type="FILE" disabled>
<select disabled></select>
<select role="button" disabled></select>

<fieldset disabled><button>Save</button></fieldset>
<fieldset role="button" disabled></fieldset>

<div role="button" disabled>Save</div>
<div role="unknown button" disabled>Save</div>
<a role="button" disabled>Save</a>
<mrow role="button" disabled></mrow>

```

